        "name": "avg_npc_240",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Hm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wow. There are so many people here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry. Please make way\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovementsp",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.7,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Aah!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1687_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been to Millington Street already. It was picked clean ages ago! The shops are still open, but the shelves are all empty! Even the shopping bags are gone!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Impatient Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kraman said they had stuff left here, so I ran five blocks only to find not even a single fowlbeast feather left!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Impatient Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "Might as well go back, grab my crossbow, and sneak past the guards to hunt in the Dark Woods\u2014at least I might get some real meat before I starve.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Impatient Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_240",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1689_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've really gone crazy from hunger now\u2014going into the forest is a death wish!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1687_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you're <i>not</i> crazy? Stop talking like you know anything!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Impatient Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1689_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who are you to say I don't know anything? The grain store on Lagran Street, Emma's place, you know about it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1687_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haven't had a chance to check it out yet. What of it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Impatient Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1689_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I went there and had a look. There's no grain left, but from what Emma says, it's all because of those bloody Victorians!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1687_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Victorian bastards have been blockading us since forever. This isn't new, so why act like it's a big shock?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Impatient Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1689_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because their spies have already infiltrated Na Saoirs\u00ed!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1687_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come again?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Impatient Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1689_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "When Emma went to visit the ag plate, she saw the charred remains with her own eyes. Dublinn is still investigating!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1687_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Bloody hell! We should've struck back the minute Tara gained independence!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Impatient Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1689_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right about one thing though: you should go get your crossbow. Not to hunt, but to root out the traitors!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, if <i>I</i> caught them, I wouldn't let them off that easy. A quick death is too good for them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_footstep_stonestep",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "channel": "step",
        "loop": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
