    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_240",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_240",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "(*Whispers*) I guess the stores have been cut off from the supply of grain...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "text": "(*Whispers*) I boiled a few potatoes for Culann, but is it enough?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "text": "(*Whispers*) There are too many people here. I'll take another route.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "text": "(*Whispers*) Lots of them are armed too...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "text": "(*Whispers*) Are they planning to hunt down Victorian spies? But there's no grain left in the city... what does that have to do with the Victorians?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "text": "(*Whispers*) But I....",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "text": "(*Whispers*) I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_240",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll be fine. I'm Mr. Culann's apprentice\u2014everyone knows that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't be afraid, Theo. No one will hurt you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_cloakmovement",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Theo crouches down and squeezes through the crowd, making his way to the opposite corner of the street. He nimbly slips through a dark, narrow passage and emerges on the other side of a brick wall."
    },
    {
        "text": "The noise of the crowd gradually fades from his ears."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
