    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_240",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "....See? No one gave me any trouble.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Culann must still be busy with the dragon sculpture. By the time he notices what's going on around him, all the stores will be empty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need to help him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_footstep_stonestep",
