        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take these and give them to the neighbors. Tell them not to worry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1688_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about you? Or Nemos? Will she have anything to eat?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friendly Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "Instead of giving us grain, it'd be more useful to help everyone catch the spies. Otherwise, we'll never get to the root of the problem.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friendly Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'll go. Please let everyone know.",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But for now, just take them.",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nemos stands with The Leader, so it's only natural to endure a little hardship for everyone's sake.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1688_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Alright then. Thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friendly Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1686_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey Culann, you must have more where that came from, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brooding Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, how'd you know we'd be running out of grains? Did Nemos tip you off in advance, or...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brooding Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1688_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you saying, Rory?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friendly Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you don't want any, fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1686_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "How do I know you or Nemos aren't spies? You've both been raising that Victorian boy together!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brooding Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Get out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1686_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What, did I hit a nerve? Am I right? Are you really\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brooding Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1752_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1752_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Culann! I heard you've been distributing grain! Impeccable timing! So where is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everything that's left is right here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1686_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't change the subject. You still haven't answered me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brooding Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've said everything I had to say. If you feel these potatoes will dirty your hands, then give them to someone else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1686_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why you\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brooding Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1752_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you want them or not, Rory? If not, then let me have them. There are plenty of hungry bellies to feed. Don't be ungrateful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now give them here\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1686_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why should I?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brooding Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1752_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't want them, right? So give them to me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1686_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fat chance!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brooding Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1752_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
