        "name": "avg_npc_1688_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Y-You're the only one we can count on, Culann.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friendly Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1688_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Something's been off about Rory lately, I'll follow him a bit, to check up on him. He's been out of sorts ever since his antique collection got burned in the war.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friendly Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for his blade, just take it. Don't let him have it back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friendly Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_footstep_stonestep",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "channel": "wstep",
        "loop": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "wstep",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1752_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Culann... I... Ughh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The wound isn't too deep. Come here, I'll stop the bleeding. As far as the grains, I'll have Nemos think of a solution when she gets back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1752_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know... ow ow ow... I know. You're giving away everything you have.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you know, you're not as scary as you look\u2014",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Anxious Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "action": "shake",
        "random": true,
        "power": 5,
        "times": 60,
        "duration": 0.3
    },
    {
        "text": "Ow!",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Anxious Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't talk. Save your energy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "text": "I might have some cornmeal left at home. Let me check.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can have it, then I'll walk you home.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
