        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Culann! Are you and Theo doing alright\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Why is there blood in here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rory lost control and slashed someone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where's Theo?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "He left a while ago for\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dammit!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You\u2014",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh* Forget it. No one could have foreseen things getting so bad, so quickly.",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "How are things in the city?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rumors are spreading everywhere that the Victorians destroyed the ag plate, and Na Saoirs\u00ed is about to boil over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know no one dared to go after Theo after you stood up for him, so you felt safe letting him run around. But this time... it's different.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to go find him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you have time for that? Aren't you making that statue?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It only needs to be finished before Samhain. There's still a little time left...",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dammit! Dammit!",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll worry about Theo. You just focus on your work.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1697_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Culann"
