    },
    {
        "text": "Theo!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you doing here, Wakewoman?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, you're\u2014oh, 'The Singer'. What brings you here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_247",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_247",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard rumors of chaos in the city, so I thought there might be something I could do to help. Alas, there is not. All I've heard is that the supply shortage was caused by Victorian sabotage.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Singer'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_247",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've only ever run into the Victorian army by accident, and you and Culann were the ones to save me at the time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Singer'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Also, the information you've provided us on the wakemen has been truly fascinating\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Singer'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, sorry sir, but I really don't have time to be reminiscing. But I could use your assistance. Culann's apprentice, Theo, has gone missing. Can you help me look for him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_247",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am... unable to help with that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Singer'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_247",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The cityfolk are angry enough at the Victorians to flay one alive. Why bother running around looking for a Victorian child?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Singer'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forget it then. I'll go look myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_247",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Remember that the celebration will start in just over an hour. Don't you need to deliver the sacred instruments symbolizing the wakemen's blessings to the venue?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Singer'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gah!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_247",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh* Sorry, I really must be going now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Singer'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
